# Cloudflare Workers static-asset upload: excludes these from what
# `wrangler deploy` uploads and serves, the same way .gitignore excludes
# from git. `directory = "."` in wrangler.toml otherwise means everything
# at repo root, this file included, would be treated as a servable asset.
.git
.github
.wrangler
wrangler.toml
.assetsignore
.gitignore
CLAUDE.md
README.md
docs/
tools/
